  s0: Sent
  s1: Refused
  s2: Signed in
  s3: Wallet step built
  s4: Paired
  s5: Blocked
  s6: Handed to the wallet
  s7: Acts as the Key
  s8: Reading current
  s9: Landed on chain
  s10: Reverted
  s11: Edits open
  s12: Saved
  s13: Message sent
  s14: Project deleted
  s15: Pin saved
  s16: Poll vote counted
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the sign-in fails
  s0 --> s2: the agent signs in
  s2 --> s3: its pairing is found [wallet step]
  s2 --> s1: no pairing
  s2 --> s4: its pairing is found
  s3 --> s5: the site's record has no Key for it yet or the chain says it may not act for the Key
  s3 --> s6: the chain says it may act for the Key
  s4 --> s1: it acts as no Key
  s4 --> s7: it acts as the Key
  s5 --> s10: the contract refuses it
  s6 --> s9: the contract takes it
  s7 --> s8: the chain reading is current
  s7 --> s1: the chain reading is late
  s8 --> s1: the Key's edits are restricted
  s8 --> s11: the Key's edits are open or no restriction check [polls, messages]
  s11 --> s12: the action's own rule allows it
  s11 --> s1: the action's own rule says no or the Key's agent voting is off
  s11 --> s13: the action's own rule allows it
  s11 --> s16: the action's own rule allows it
  s11 --> s14: the action's own rule allows it
  s11 --> s15: the action's own rule allows it
